Subject: Use finger coordinates for touchscreen viewport dragging

Viewport dragging reads the SDL mouse position, which can remain stale when
the right button is synthesized from a double tap. Return the finger position
in physical pixels and ignore synthetic touch mouse motion. Update the touch
position on press and release as well as motion.

Upstream-Status: Pending

